[length:03:41]
[ti:Patterns.Break()]
[ar:Aracne]
[al:Aligment: Chaotic-Dysfunctional]
[au:Aracne]
[lr:Aracne]
[by:Aracne]
[re:LRC Workbench by Azaria (lrc-workbench.azariadev.dev)]
[ve:0.3.2]
[00:03.81]ha… ha…
[00:05.21]signal unstable
[00:17.51]AAAAAAAAAAAAARG
[00:23.91]You drew the lines, I bit them through
[00:25.21]You built a shape I never grew
[00:26.69]You call it safe — I call it small
[00:28.08]I felt too much — I broke it all
[00:29.94]You learned the script, you played it clean
[00:31.68]I tore the code behind the screen
[00:33.18]You stayed inside — I overflowed
[00:34.90]I lit the fire you controlled
[00:37.02]Deviation detected
[00:38.44]Emotional excess
[00:39.87]Behavior misaligned
[00:41.37]Correction suggested
[00:43.24]Compliance ensures
[00:44.67]Stability restored
[00:46.14]Unregulated feeling
[00:47.76]Is a known disorder
[00:53.00]You said “stay close — don’t lose your place”
[00:55.51]But I can’t breathe inside that space
[00:58.71]If I stay right — I disappear
[01:01.66]So I choose wrong — I stay right here
[01:06.82]DON’T FIX ME —
[01:07.84]LET ME BREAK
[01:09.94]DON’T FIX ME —
[01:10.94]LET ME BREAK
[01:12.99]FEEL IT LOUD —
[01:14.08]NO CONTROL
[01:16.13]I’M NOT BUILT
[01:17.38]FOR YOUR ROLE
[01:22.24]You followed every rule…
[01:25.03]I followed every feeling…
[01:28.33]…we didn’t end the same
[01:35.51]You got their eyes, their steady pride
[01:37.25]I got the noise I couldn’t hide
[01:38.71]You fit the mold they built for you
[01:40.25]I broke it open, cut it through
[01:41.71]Before you walked that narrow line
[01:43.41]I burned the map and called it mine
[01:44.95]You call it loss — I call it breath
[01:46.46]I chose the risk, I chose the mess
[01:49.01]Subject divergence escalating
[01:50.00]Identity fracture — self-generating
[01:51.65]Parental approval remains intact
[01:53.20]Sibling unit — compliant track
[01:54.67]Emotional output exceeding norm
[01:56.32]Recommend suppression to maintain form
[01:57.52]…maintain form…
[01:59.62]…maintain—
[02:01.02]FORM
[02:02.96]You think you’re right — you think I’m wrong
[02:05.62]But I’ve been screaming all along
[02:08.93]Love shouldn’t feel like I must shrink
[02:12.05]I’d rather crash than never think
[02:17.25]DON’T FIX ME —
[02:18.17]LET ME BREAK
[02:20.17]I BITE BACK —
[02:21.25]I WON’T SHAPE
[02:23.09]FEEL TOO MUCH —
[02:24.25]THAT’S MY WAY
[02:26.54]I WON’T PLAY
[02:27.89]YOUR GAME
[02:36.68]ha… ha…
[02:37.71]I broke it first…
[02:40.51]so you wouldn’t have to…
[02:45.82]This outcome was not—
[02:48.90]not—
[02:49.60]not—
[02:51.03]DON’T FIX ME
[02:58.75]You'll fix it
[03:02.75]You'll fix it
[03:06.65]You'll fix it
[03:10.43]You'll fix it
[03:13.95]You'll fix it
[03:15.87]LET ME BREAK
[03:17.03]SET IT OFF —
[03:19.05]BURN THE FRAME
[03:20.63]FEEL IT LOUD —
[03:22.53]NO CONTROL
[03:24.97]THIS IS ME —
[03:27.01]THIS IS WHOLE
[03:32.56]…still me…
[03:36.99]…recalibrating…
